torrent-not-checked = Die Verbindung konnte nicht geprüft werden. { $reason }

# Note on the sources screen after the source chain is rebuilt with torrents on.
sources-reloaded-torrents-pending = Quellen neu geladen. Torrents starten, sobald der VPN-Wächter freigibt.

# Note on the sources screen after the source chain is rebuilt with torrents off.
sources-reloaded-torrents-off = Torrents sind aus. Die Sitzung wurde beendet.

# Note on a running job: requests to AniList are being slowed to stay within its limit. A countdown follows.
job-anilist-limit = Wartet auf das Anfragelimit von AniList

# Toast when there is no job to carry the wait for AniList's rate limit.
notice-anilist-limit = Wartet { $wait } wegen des Anfragelimits von AniList.

# Toast when the AniList fallback takes over because AniList cannot be reached.
notice-anilist-unreachable = AniList antwortet nicht. Vorerst werden Daten von einem anderen Dienst angezeigt.

# Toast when no metadata service answered and the last cached data is shown.
notice-metadata-cached = Kein Metadaten-Dienst hat geantwortet. Gezeigt wird, was zuletzt zwischengespeichert wurde.

# Toast when AniList answers again.
notice-anilist-back = AniList ist wieder da.

# Toast when a command needs watch parties but this app was built without them.
notice-party-not-built = Watchpartys sind in dieser App nicht eingebaut.

# Toast after a tracker sign-in succeeded. The tracker is its name, such as AniList.
notice-signed-in = Bei { $tracker } angemeldet.

# Toast after a sign-in succeeded and the token went into the system keychain.
notice-signed-in-keychain = Bei { $tracker } angemeldet. Das Token liegt im Schlüsselbund des Systems.

# Toast after a sign-in succeeded on a device with no keychain. The token is in a file only this user can read. It is said so that someone on a shared computer knows.
notice-signed-in-file = Bei { $tracker } angemeldet. Es ist kein Schlüsselbund verfügbar, deshalb liegt das Token in einer privaten Datei auf diesem Gerät.

# Toast when a sign-in worked but the token could not be stored. The reason comes from the system.
notice-signed-in-unsaved = Bei { $tracker } angemeldet, aber das Token wurde nicht gespeichert. Beim nächsten Mal musst du dich erneut anmelden. { $reason }

# Toast when a sign-in token could not be stored. The reason comes from the system.
notice-token-not-saved = Das Anmelde-Token konnte nicht gespeichert werden. Melde dich erneut an. { $reason }

# Toast when a sign-in did not finish. The reason comes from the tracker or the network.
notice-sign-in-failed = Anmeldung bei { $tracker } fehlgeschlagen. Versuche es noch einmal. { $reason }

# Toast when the wait for a sign-in ended early. The reason comes from the system.
notice-sign-in-stopped = Die Anmeldung bei { $tracker } wurde beendet, bevor sie fertig war. Versuche es noch einmal. { $reason }

# Toast when a tracker would not give a token for the sign-in. The reason comes from the tracker.
notice-token-exchange-failed = Kein Token von { $tracker } erhalten. Melde dich erneut an. { $reason }

# Toast when no browser could be opened for a sign-in. The reason comes from the system.
notice-browser-not-opened = Für die Anmeldung konnte kein Browser geöffnet werden. Prüfe, ob einer installiert ist, und versuche es erneut. { $reason }

# Toast when a sign-in redirect arrives and no sign-in is waiting for it.
notice-sign-in-not-waiting = Auf diese Anmeldung bei { $tracker } wartet gerade nichts. Starte die Anmeldung erneut.

# Toast when a sign-in redirect does not match the request that was made.
notice-sign-in-wrong-request = Die Antwort von { $tracker } passt nicht zu dieser Anfrage. Starte die Anmeldung erneut.

# Toast when a tracker sent the person back without a token.
notice-sign-in-no-token = Die Anmeldung bei { $tracker } kam ohne Token zurück. Versuche es noch einmal.

# Toast when this build has no MyAnimeList client to finish a sign-in with.
notice-mal-client-missing-build = Die Anmeldung bei MyAnimeList konnte nicht abgeschlossen werden: Dieser Build hat dafür keinen Client.

# Toast on a screen that opens Kitsu's sign-in as a prompt. It is shown with a button to open it.
notice-kitsu-signs-in-on-accounts = Die Anmeldung bei Kitsu erfolgt über den Bildschirm Konten.

# Toast when a tracker has no way to sign in yet.
notice-sign-in-unsupported = Die Anmeldung bei { $tracker } wird noch nicht unterstützt.

# Toast on an app that cannot receive a browser redirect.
notice-sign-in-needs-redirect = Die Anmeldung bei { $tracker } braucht eine Weiterleitung aus dem Browser, die diese App nicht annehmen kann.

# Toast when AniList is set to a sign-in method only the anistream app can finish. The setting name is a key of the config file and is not translated.
notice-anilist-implicit-flow = Diese AniList-Anmeldemethode funktioniert nur in der App anistream. Um hier anzumelden, setze { $setting } in der Konfigurationsdatei auf „loopback“.

# Toast when AniList sign-in needs a client id and secret in the config file. The setting names and the command are not translated.
notice-anilist-client-missing = AniList braucht eine Client-ID und ein Geheimnis. Setze { $client } und { $secret } in der Konfigurationsdatei und melde dich dann erneut an. Um die Anmeldeadresse zu erhalten, führe anistream --login-url aus.

# Toast when AniList is set to paste the code by hand, which a running terminal app cannot take. Terminal only: the engine never sends it to the apps.
notice-anilist-paste-flow = Einen Code einzufügen ist hier nicht möglich. Beende das Programm und starte anistream stattdessen mit --login.

# Toast when MyAnimeList sign-in needs a client id in the config file. The setting name and the address are not translated.
notice-mal-client-missing = MyAnimeList braucht eine Client-ID. Registriere auf myanimelist.net/apiconfig eine App vom Typ „other“ und setze dann { $setting } in der Konfigurationsdatei.

# Job note while the browser sign-in is open and the terminal app waits for it to come back.
status-waiting-for-redirect = Warte darauf, dass { $tracker } zurückleitet…

# Toast when MyAnimeList signed in without a refresh token, so the sign-in lapses in about a month.
notice-mal-no-refresh-token = MyAnimeList hat kein Refresh-Token ausgegeben. In etwa einem Monat musst du dich erneut anmelden.

# Toast when a device-code sign-in needs a client id in the config file. The setting name is a key of the config file and is not translated.
notice-client-id-missing = Setze zuerst { $setting } in der Konfigurationsdatei.

# Toast after signing out of a tracker with nothing waiting to send.
notice-signed-out = Bei { $tracker } abgemeldet.

# Toast after signing out of a tracker. The changes were not discarded: they are sent after the next sign-in.
notice-signed-out-queue =
    { $count ->
        [one] Bei { $tracker } abgemeldet. Eine wartende Änderung wird für die nächste Anmeldung aufbewahrt.
       *[other] Bei { $tracker } abgemeldet. { $count } wartende Änderungen werden für die nächste Anmeldung aufbewahrt.
    }

# Toast when signing out of a tracker failed. The reason comes from the system.
notice-sign-out-failed = Abmeldung bei { $tracker } fehlgeschlagen. Versuche es noch einmal. { $reason }

# Toast when a setting could not be stored. The cause says why and what to do.
notice-not-saved-because = Diese Einstellung konnte nicht gespeichert werden. { $cause }

# Toast when the torrent protection choice was saved.
notice-protection-saved = Torrent-Schutz gespeichert.

# Toast when the torrent protection could not be checked. The cause says why.
notice-protection-not-checked = Der Torrent-Schutz konnte nicht geprüft werden. { $cause }

# Toast when the proxy's password could not be stored. The reason comes from the system.
notice-proxy-password-not-kept = Das Passwort des Proxys konnte nicht gespeichert werden. Gib es erneut ein, um das Speichern zu versuchen. { $reason }

# Toast when a show's setting was given a value it does not take. The value is what was given.
notice-show-setting-refused = Diese Einstellung konnte nicht gespeichert werden. { $value } ist kein gültiger Wert für { $setting }.

# Toast when resetting a show's settings failed. The reason comes from the local database.
notice-show-not-reset = Die Einstellungen dieser Serie konnten nicht zurückgesetzt werden. { $reason }

# Toast when a subtitle choice names subtitles the show has not used.
notice-show-no-such-subtitles = Diese Untertitelauswahl konnte nicht gespeichert werden. Die Serie hat diese Untertitel bisher nicht verwendet.

# Toast while torrents are held until the connection check passes.
notice-torrents-waiting-for-check = Torrents warten, bis die Verbindungsprüfung wieder besteht.

# Toast when the mapping data downloads work again after a failure.
notice-mapping-data-refreshed = Zuordnungsdaten aktualisiert.

# Toast when the mapping data could not be downloaded. It is said once; the retries are silent.
notice-mapping-data-failed = Die Zuordnungsdaten ({ $datasets }) konnten nicht aktualisiert werden. Neuer Versuch in { $wait }. { $cause }

# Toast, and desktop notification, for one episode that aired while the app was closed.
notice-episode-aired = { $title }, Folge { $episode }, ist erschienen, während du weg warst.

# Toast, and desktop notification, for several episodes that aired while the app was closed.
notice-episodes-aired =
    { $count ->
        [one] Eine neue Folge einer Serie, die du schaust, ist erschienen. Sie steht im Kalender.
       *[other] { $count } neue Folgen von Serien, die du schaust, sind erschienen. Sie stehen im Kalender.
    }

# Toast when a new release of anistream is out, on the terminal app. The command is not translated. Terminal only: the engine never sends it to the apps.
notice-update-available = { $tag } ist da. Führe anistream --update aus, um es zu installieren.

# The reason a setting was refused until the person confirms having no protection.
cause-confirm-no-protection = Bestätige zuerst, dass du keinen Schutz willst.

# The reason a setting was refused until the person confirms the "warn only" choice.
cause-confirm-warn-only = Bestätige zuerst, dass du nur gewarnt werden willst.

# The reason a proxy was refused: it has no host or no port.
cause-proxy-needs-address = Ein Proxy braucht einen Host und einen Port.

# The reason a proxy could not be checked: its address is not one the check can use.
cause-proxy-address-unusable = Die Adresse des Proxys kann für eine Prüfung nicht verwendet werden.

# The reason a request failed: it never reached the server.
cause-server-unreachable = Der Server war nicht erreichbar.

# Toast after a setting is stored. The label is the setting's name.
notice-saved = { $label } gespeichert.

# Toast when a setting could not be stored. The reason comes from the system.
notice-not-saved = Diese Einstellung konnte nicht gespeichert werden. { $reason }

# Toast when a title's details did not load.
notice-title-load-failed = Dieser Titel konnte nicht geladen werden. Prüfe deine Verbindung und versuche es erneut.

# Toast when playback stops with an error.
notice-playback-failed = Die Wiedergabe ist fehlgeschlagen. Probiere eine andere Quelle.

# Toast when something went wrong inside the engine and it carried on.
notice-engine-fault = In anistream ist etwas schiefgelaufen. Es läuft weiter, aber wenn ein Bildschirm hängen bleibt, beende anistream und öffne es erneut.

# Toast at launch when the database was damaged, so a fresh one was started. The path is where the damaged file was moved, kept for recovery. Watch history and downloads start over; what the trackers hold comes back with the next sync.
notice-database-set-aside = Die Datenbank war beschädigt, deshalb hat anistream eine neue angelegt. Die alte Datei liegt unter { $path }. Deine Tracker holen beim nächsten Abgleich zurück, was sie gespeichert haben.

# Message when anistream could not start because a folder could not be made. The path is the folder, the reason comes from the system.
start-failed-folder = anistream konnte den Ordner { $path } nicht anlegen. Prüfe, ob die Festplatte genug Platz hat und der Ordner beschreibbar ist, und versuche es dann erneut. { $reason }

# Message when anistream could not start because the config file has a setting it can't use. The path is the file; the problem names the line where it can.
start-failed-config = { $path } enthält eine Einstellung, die anistream nicht verwenden kann: { $problem }. Korrigiere oder entferne sie und versuche es dann erneut.

# Message when anistream could not start because its database could not be opened. The path is the database file, the reason comes from the system.
start-failed-database = anistream konnte die Datenbank unter { $path } nicht öffnen. Ist ein anderes anistream in diesem Ordner geöffnet, beende es und versuche es erneut. { $reason }

# Message when anistream could not start its network connection from the network settings.
start-failed-network = anistream konnte die Netzwerkverbindung nicht aus den Netzwerkeinstellungen in config.toml einrichten. { $reason }

# Message when anistream itself could not start. The reason comes from the system or the engine.
start-failed = anistream konnte nicht gestartet werden. Beende anistream und öffne es erneut. { $reason }

# Message when the TV remote could not start listening or could not forget a phone.
start-failed-remote = Die Fernbedienung konnte nicht gestartet werden. { $reason }

# Message when the built-in player could not start.
start-failed-player = Der Player konnte nicht gestartet werden. { $reason }

# Toast after episodes are added to the download queue.
notice-episodes-queued =
    { $count ->
        [one] Eine Folge in die Warteschlange gestellt.
       *[other] { $count } Folgen in die Warteschlange gestellt.
    }

# Note under the connection-check group of the torrents dialog: what the check does.
torrents-linux-check-note = anistream prüft beim Start eines Torrents und danach jede Minute, von wo der Torrent-Verkehr ausgeht, und hält Torrents an, wenn die Prüfung fehlschlägt. Geschützt bist du durch dein VPN oder deinen Proxy.

# Confirmation text when choosing "Warn only" for a failed check.
torrents-linux-warn-confirm = anistream warnt dich, statt anzuhalten. Wenn dein VPN oder Proxy ausgefallen ist, können andere deine IP-Adresse sehen.

# Status line once the protection has been checked and saved.
torrents-linux-protection-saved = Torrent-Schutz gespeichert

# Title of the dialog that turns torrents on.
torrents-linux-turn-on-title = Torrents einschalten

# Title of the dialog that changes what protects torrents.
torrents-linux-protect-title = Torrents schützen

# Title of the dialog that edits the proxy.
torrents-linux-edit-proxy-title = Proxy bearbeiten

# Button that turns torrents on in the dialog.
torrents-linux-turn-on-button = Einschalten

# Seeding row: time left until the goal, in a span already worded ("18h", "1d 6h").
downloads-linux-seed-left = { $span } übrig

# Seeding row: less than an hour left until the goal.
downloads-linux-seed-left-soon = Weniger als eine Stunde übrig

# Storage row: free space, the disk's size and what downloads take. All three are sizes already formatted.
downloads-linux-space-free = { $free } von { $total } frei · Downloads belegen { $taken }

# Placeholder of the search field. It also finds settings.
search-linux-placeholder = Titel und Einstellungen suchen

# Tooltip of the button that clears the recent searches.
search-linux-clear-recent = Letzte Suchen löschen

# Title of the state when a browse with no filters lists nothing.
search-linux-nothing-found = Nichts gefunden

# Title of the state when a typed search waits for Enter.
search-linux-press-enter = Enter drücken, um zu suchen

# Line under the Enter title: why results do not come as you type. The tracker is a name.
search-linux-paused = Die Suche während der Eingabe ist kurz pausiert, um die Grenzen von { $tracker } einzuhalten.

# Menu title over the sort choices of the filter row.
filter-linux-sort-by = Sortieren nach

# Sort choice: what is rising now.
filter-linux-sort-trending = Im Trend

# Sort choice: the most recent first.
filter-linux-sort-newest = Neueste

# Sort choice: the earliest first.
filter-linux-sort-oldest = Älteste

# Sort choice: the most favourited first.
filter-linux-sort-favourites = Favoriten

# Genre filter button when several genres are set.
filter-linux-genres-count =
    { $count ->
        [one] { $count } Genre
       *[other] { $count } Genres
    }

# Format filter button when several formats are set.
filter-linux-formats-count =
    { $count ->
        [one] { $count } Format
       *[other] { $count } Formate
    }

# Status filter button when several statuses are set.
filter-linux-statuses-count =
    { $count ->
        [one] { $count } Status
       *[other] { $count } Status
    }

# Chip for a genre that is left out of the results. The genre is already named.
filter-linux-not = Ohne { $genre }

# Button that takes off every filter chip.
filter-linux-clear-all = Alle löschen

# Tooltip of the arrow that scrolls the filter row back.
filter-linux-earlier = Frühere Filter

# Tooltip of the arrow that scrolls the filter row on.
filter-linux-more = Weitere Filter

# What a screen reader says for a broadcast whose time is an estimate. The time is already formatted.
calendar-linux-about = ungefähr { $time }

# What a screen reader says for a broadcast that is the dub's.
calendar-linux-dubbed = synchronisiert

# Title of the menu, and tooltip of its button, that orders a list.
library-linux-order = Sortierung

# A list's tab: its name and how many titles it holds.
library-linux-list-count = { $list } { $count }

# Description read by a screen reader on the button that plays the shown episode on a TV.
title-linux-play-on-tv-help = Diese Folge auf einem Fernseher mit anistream abspielen

# Description read by a screen reader on an episode's watched check box.
title-linux-episode-watched = Folge { $episode } gesehen

# Line in a day's column when nothing airs that day.
calendar-linux-day-empty = Nichts wird ausgestrahlt

# Accessible label of the line that says how the watch party form is getting on.
party-status = Watchparty-Status

# Accessible label of the list of people in the watch party, in the player's panel.
party-members = Mitglieder

# Title of the dialog that lists the sources that have the watch party's episode.
party-choose-a-source = Eine Quelle wählen

# Line when no source lists the watch party's episode. A plugin store adds plugins, which add sources.
party-sources-none-listed = Keine Quelle listet Episode { $episode } auf. Quellen stammen von Plugins, die ein Plugin-Store hinzufügt.

# Line above the list of sources that have the watch party's episode.
party-sources-found-line =
    { $count ->
        [one] Eine Quelle hat sie. Die gewählte spielt mit der Watchparty ab.
       *[other] { $count } Quellen haben sie. Die gewählte spielt mit der Watchparty ab.
    }

# Notice when the player could not start, or could not be reached to add a track.
player-could-not-start = Der Player konnte nicht starten. Versuch es noch einmal oder wähle eine andere Quelle.

# Notice when the file chosen for a subtitle or audio track has no path the app can read.
player-file-unreadable = Datei nicht lesbar. Versuch eine andere.

# The reason the system gives for keeping the screen awake and the computer from sleeping while an episode plays. Other apps and the desktop may show it.
player-inhibit-reason = Spielt eine Episode ab

# Accessible description of the time left in the episode, beside the countdown.
player-time-left = { $time } übrig

# Line on the starting screen after a note from the engine, with the seconds waited.
player-note-waited = { $note } · { $seconds } s

# Starting screen's line before the episode is known.
player-starting-plain = Startet

# Tooltip of the Undo button on the card that says an opening was skipped. The letter is the key that does the same.
player-undo-tooltip = Rückgängig (U)

# Over the timeline: the time under the pointer, when it is inside an opening.
player-time-opening = { $clock } · Intro

# Over the timeline: the time under the pointer, when it is inside an ending.
player-time-ending = { $clock } · Outro

# Name of a one-channel audio track in the audio menu.
player-channels-mono = Mono

# Name of a two-channel audio track in the audio menu.
player-channels-stereo = Stereo

# Name of an audio track with some other number of channels.
player-channels =
    { $count ->
        [one] 1 Kanal
       *[other] { $count } Kanäle
    }

# Accessible label of the two buttons that switch between subbed and dubbed audio.
player-translation-label = Untertitelt/synchronisiert

# Tooltip on the button that opens a setting's preview on a page of its own, and accessible name of the preview.
settings-preview = Vorschau

# Tooltip on the button that steps a setting to its previous value.
settings-previous-value = Vorheriger Wert

# Tooltip on the button that steps a setting to its next value.
settings-next-value = Nächster Wert

# Line after the legal line under the sources settings: where sources come from.
settings-sources-come-from = Quellen stammen aus den Plugin-Stores, denen du beitrittst.

# Label on the left half of the upscaling preview: the video before processing.
settings-preview-source = 480p Quelle

# Preview note under the upscaling frame when upscaling is off.
settings-upscaling-note-off = Die 480p Quelle wird ohne Verarbeitung passend skaliert.

# A line of sample subtitle over the preview frame. Any short sentence will do.
settings-caption-sample = Die Laternenstraße führt hinter der letzten Stadt weiter.

# Preview note under the subtitle frame. The language is a language name.
settings-caption-note = So sehen einfache Untertitel aus, in { $language }, wenn eine Folge sie hat. Gestaltete Untertitel behalten ihr eigenes Aussehen.

# Preview note for new-episode notifications when they are on. The tracker is a name such as AniList.
settings-notify-note-on = Eine Benachrichtigung, wenn eine Folge einer Serie aus deiner Liste „Wird geschaut“ erscheint, zu der Zeit, die { $tracker } angibt. Die eigene Einstellung einer Serie hat Vorrang.

# Preview note for new-episode notifications when they are off.
settings-notify-note-off = Aus. Nur Serien, die in ihren eigenen Einstellungen eingeschaltet sind, benachrichtigen.

# Heading of the preview note beside the sources settings while torrents are on.
settings-connection-check-title = Verbindungsprüfung

# Preview note beside the sources settings while torrents are on.
settings-connection-check-note = anistream prüft, von wo der Torrent-Verkehr ausgeht, wenn ein Torrent startet und danach jede Minute, solange er läuft. Schlägt die Prüfung fehl, pausiert anistream Torrents. Dein VPN oder Proxy schützt dich.

# Preview note beside the accounts settings.
settings-accounts-note = anistream funktioniert ohne Konto. Dein Sehverlauf bleibt auf diesem Computer, wenn du dich abmeldest.

# Preview note beside the Discord settings when presence is on.
settings-presence-note-on = Dein Discord-Profil zeigt, was du schaust, während eine Folge läuft.

# Preview note beside the Discord settings when presence is off.
settings-presence-note-off = Aus. Wenn sie an ist, zeigt dein Discord-Profil, was du schaust, während eine Folge läuft.

# Preview note beside the advanced settings.
settings-advanced-note = Eine Option hier kann eine Einstellung bei der Wiedergabe aufheben, etwa Hochskalierung oder Nachtmodus. Die meisten brauchen diesen Bereich nie.

# Button that opens the page of the new version of the app.
updates-view-version = Version ansehen

# Accessible name of the progress bar while the new version downloads.
updates-progress-label = Fortschritt des Updates

# Line under AniList's name on the Accounts page.
accounts-sync-detail = Fortschritt und Änderungen an Listen werden mit { $tracker } abgeglichen. Mediathek und „Meine Liste“ im Kalender zeigen deine { $tracker }-Listen.

# Line under a signed-in account while changes wait for the connection.
accounts-changes-waiting-offline =
    { $count ->
        [one] Eine Änderung wartet, bis du online bist
       *[other] { $count } Änderungen warten, bis du online bist
    }

# Footnote on the Accounts page: where sign-in tokens are kept, when it is the system's keyring.
accounts-tokens-keyring = Anmelde-Tokens werden im Schlüsselbund von diesem Gerät gespeichert.

# Reason an update stopped: the downloaded file could not be read. The reason is the system's own words.
updates-why-read = Der Download konnte nicht gelesen werden: { $reason }

# Reason an update stopped: the new version is in place but did not open.
updates-why-reopen = Die neue Version ist installiert, konnte aber nicht geöffnet werden. Öffne anistream erneut.

# Accessible description of the mascot's picture. Nagare is the mascot's name.
nagare-description = Nagare, das Maskottchen von anistream: eine Figur mit Seidenbob, bernsteinfarbenem Schal und indigoblauem Umhang, die einen Stab mit Wasseramulett hält.

# Note under the Play trailers setting: what the trailers are and when they do not play.
settings-note-trailers-linux = Trailer laufen stumm über YouTube, das deine IP-Adresse sieht. Sie spielen nicht über eine getaktete Verbindung, mit deaktivierten Animationen, im Energiesparmodus oder wenn ein Bildschirmleser läuft.

# Settings row: whether a connected game controller drives the app.
settings-label-controller-input = Controller verwenden

# Settings row: swaps the A and B buttons, for a controller laid out as Nintendo's are.
settings-label-swap-face-buttons = A und B tauschen

# Heading of the Settings group for game controllers.
settings-group-controller = Controller

# Settings row that names the controller in use.
settings-controller-device = Controller

# Value of the controller row when no controller is connected.
settings-controller-none = Kein Controller gefunden. Steam-Input-Tastaturlayouts funktionieren weiterhin.

# Notice when a controller connects for the first time in a session.
controller-connected = Controller verbunden · { $name }

# Notice when the controller in use disconnects.
controller-disconnected = Controller getrennt

# Title of the window that lists what the controller's buttons do.
controller-help-title = Controller

# Accessible name of the list of controller buttons in the help window.
controller-help-buttons = Controller-Tasten

# Button on a notice that asks to open the plugin stores.
shell-open-stores = Plugin-Stores öffnen

# Button on an update notice that restarts the app to install it.
shell-restart = Neu starten

# Button on a notice that a newer version is out: opens its page.
shell-view-release = Ansehen

# Notice when the app cannot keep running once its window is closed.
shell-no-background = anistream kann hier nicht im Hintergrund weiterlaufen, deshalb werden Downloads beim Schließen des Fensters angehalten.

# Tooltip of the main menu button in the sidebar's header.
shell-main-menu = Hauptmenü

# Sidebar line under a signed-out account: opens the accounts page to connect a tracker.
shell-connect-tracker = { $tracker } verbinden

# Sidebar line under the account when changes wait to be sent to the tracker.
shell-changes-waiting =
    { $count ->
        [one] Eine Änderung zu synchronisieren
       *[other] { $count } Änderungen zu synchronisieren
    }

# Sidebar line under the account: the tracker, then that it is up to date.
shell-tracker-synced = { $tracker } · Aktuell

# Heading of the shortcuts that work on lists of titles.
shortcuts-group-lists = Listen

# Shortcut: jump to a section of the app by number.
shortcuts-go-to-section = Zu einem Bereich springen

# Shortcut: open the keyboard shortcuts window.
shortcuts-show = Tastenkürzel

# Shortcut: close the window.
shortcuts-close-window = Fenster schließen

# Shortcut: quit the app.
shortcuts-quit = Beenden

# Shortcut: play the title that has focus in a list.
shortcuts-play-selected = Ausgewählten Titel abspielen

# Shortcut: small steps in the player.
shortcuts-seek-5 = 5 Sekunden zurück oder vor

# Shortcut: larger steps in the player.
shortcuts-seek-30 = 30 Sekunden zurück oder vor

# Shortcut: steps of ten seconds in the player.
shortcuts-seek-10 = 10 Sekunden zurück oder vor

# Shortcut: change the volume.
shortcuts-volume = Lautstärke erhöhen oder verringern

# Shortcut: skip the opening or the ending.
shortcuts-skip = Vorspann oder Abspann überspringen

# Shortcut: undo a skip the player made by itself.
shortcuts-undo-skip = Automatisches Überspringen rückgängig machen

# Shortcut: change the playback speed.
shortcuts-speed = Schneller oder langsamer

# Shortcut: answer the card that shows in the corner of the player.
shortcuts-answer-card = Die Karte in der Ecke beantworten

# Shortcut: Escape closes the topmost thing in the player, one step at a time.
shortcuts-escape = Karte schließen, Minifenster, Vollbild, dann den Player

# Response of the close question: stop what runs and close.
close-stop-and-close = Stoppen und schließen

# Body of the close question when episodes download.
close-body-downloading =
    { $count ->
        [one] Eine Folge wird gerade heruntergeladen oder wartet darauf. Sollen sie nach dem Schließen des Fensters weiterlaufen oder angehalten werden?
       *[other] { $count } Folgen werden gerade heruntergeladen oder warten darauf. Sollen sie nach dem Schließen des Fensters weiterlaufen oder angehalten werden?
    }

# Body of the close question when episodes seed.
close-body-seeding =
    { $count ->
        [one] Eine Folge wird gerade geseedet. Soll sie nach dem Schließen des Fensters weiterlaufen oder angehalten werden?
       *[other] { $count } Folgen werden gerade geseedet. Sollen sie nach dem Schließen des Fensters weiterlaufen oder angehalten werden?
    }

# Body of the close question when some episodes download and others seed.
close-body-both = Folgen: { $downloading } werden heruntergeladen oder warten, und { $seeding } werden geseedet. Sollen sie nach dem Schließen des Fensters weiterlaufen oder angehalten werden?

# Status in the sidebar and on the remote: the TV was not found again.
tv-status-not-found = { $name } nicht gefunden

# Title of the dialog that wants a code to be typed: no name known yet.
tv-connecting-title = Verbindung zum Fernseher wird hergestellt

# Heading of a problem when the pairing code ran out.
tv-code-expired = Code abgelaufen

# Under a TV in the list: what choosing it does, for a screen reader.
tv-row-pairs-with = Koppelt mit diesem Fernseher

# Under a TV in the list: paired, but not seen on the network.
tv-row-away = Gekoppelt, im Netzwerk nicht gefunden

# Under a TV in the list: found, not paired yet.
tv-row-new = Noch nicht gekoppelt

# What a screen reader hears when a heading and its problem show together.
tv-problem-announce = { $heading }. { $problem }

# What a screen reader hears when no TV was found, then what to check.
tv-none-found-announce = Keine Fernseher gefunden. { $detail }

# Line on the picker while the episode to play is known: the show, then the episode.
tv-title-episode = { $title }, Folge { $episode }

# Line under the show on the remote and the picker: which episode.
tv-episode = Folge { $episode }

# Line on the remote under the show: the episode, then its title.
tv-episode-titled = Folge { $episode } · { $title }

# Explains the code a TV lists this computer by, above the paired TVs in the settings.
tv-fingerprint-note = Ein Fernseher listet dieses Gerät mit dem Code { $code } auf. Wenn du hier einen Fernseher vergisst, vergisst er auch dieses Gerät.

# Settings line of a paired TV: paired on a date, reached in the last minute.
tv-paired-seen-now = { $paired } · gerade eben gesehen

# Accessible name of a track menu: the row, then the track chosen.
tv-track-choice = { $row }, { $track }

# The name this computer goes by in lists of a person's devices, such as a plugin store's.
shell-device-label = Linux-Rechner

# Count of devices on a member's row in the members dialog, and after "Owner ·".
stores-device-count =
    { $count ->
        [one] { $count } Gerät
       *[other] { $count } Geräte
    }

# Accessible name of an owner's dialog: what the dialog does, then the plugin store it is for.
stores-dialog-title = { $title }, { $store }

# Title of the status page in an owner's dialog when the plugin store could not be reached. The reason is not shown here.
stores-owner-unreachable = Verbindung zum Plugin-Store nicht möglich

# Title of the status page in an owner's dialog when the plugin store did not answer in time.
stores-owner-no-answer = Der Plugin-Store hat nicht geantwortet

# Line under it.
stores-owner-no-answer-detail = Er ist vielleicht beschäftigt, oder sein Rechner ist aus.

# Title of the status page in an owner's dialog when this device is offline.
stores-owner-needs-connection = Der Plugin-Store braucht eine Verbindung

# Line under it.
stores-owner-needs-connection-detail = Versuche es erneut, sobald dieses Gerät wieder online ist.

# Red line in the invite dialog when this device is offline and a link cannot be made.
stores-owner-link-offline = Für einen Link wird eine Verbindung zum Plugin-Store benötigt.

# Line over a new invite link made for a named person. The time is the one the link stops working.
stores-send-link-until = Sende diesen Link. Er funktioniert einmal, bis { $until }.

# Row title in who-can-join: switching on lets anyone with the link join. Shown while it is on.
stores-open-on-detail = Sie treten ohne Namen bei. Ausschalten beendet den Link, wieder einschalten erstellt einen neuen.

# Row subtitle in who-can-join while it is off.
stores-open-off-detail = Nur Personen, die du einlädst, können beitreten. Eingeschaltet kann jede Person mit dem Link ohne Namen beitreten.

# Line on the summary row of devices that joined with the link, when joining is on.
stores-open-no-names = Es werden keine Namen gespeichert.

# Line on the summary row of devices that joined with the link, when joining is off.
stores-open-keep-working = Sie funktionieren weiter, bis du sie entfernst.

# Line under a device that joined with the link: when the store last saw it.
stores-device-seen = Zuletzt gesehen { $when }

# Line under a device that joined with the link and has not been seen since.
stores-device-never-seen = Seit dem Beitritt nicht gesehen

# Short title of the publish dialog, over the plugin store's name.
stores-publish-short = Ein Plugin veröffentlichen

# Line in the publish dialog when this device has no plugin to offer. Follows stores-publish-none.
stores-publish-none-hint = Ein Plugin, das du baust oder installierst, erscheint hier.

# Line under a plugin in the publish dialog that the store does not have yet.
stores-not-published = Noch nicht im Plugin-Store

# Line under a plugin in the publish dialog that the store has in another version.
stores-store-offers = Der Plugin-Store bietet { $version }

# Line under a plugin in the publish dialog whose version the store already has.
stores-published-current = Im Plugin-Store auf dem neuesten Stand

# Word at the end of that row.
stores-published-state = Veröffentlicht

# Accessible name of a row's Publish button.
stores-publish-label = { $name } { $version } veröffentlichen

# Under a release in the source picker: how many people share it right now.
source-picker-seeders-linux =
    { $count ->
        [one] Ein Seeder
       *[other] { $count } Seeder
    }

# Tooltip on the header bar button that shows the sidebar while the window is narrow.
sidebar-show = Seitenleiste anzeigen

# Faint line over Continue's placeholders while it loads.
activity-continue = Lädt, was du schaust

# Faint line over the calendar's placeholders while it loads.
activity-calendar = Kalender wird geladen

# Faint line over a title page's episode placeholders while they load.
activity-episodes = Folgen werden geladen

# Faint line over the Sources page while the sources are checked.
activity-sources = Quellen werden geprüft

# Faint line over the Downloads page while it loads.
activity-downloads = Downloads werden geladen

# Faint line over Search's placeholders while it lists titles with no query typed.
activity-browse = Titel werden geladen

# A transfer rate: a size already worded, per second.
size-per-second = { $size }/s

# A wait that is over.
time-now = Jetzt

# How long ago, when it was inside the last minute.
time-just-now = Gerade eben

# A length of time said for a screen reader, in hours.
spoken-hours =
    { $count ->
        [one] { $count } Stunde
       *[other] { $count } Stunden
    }

# A length of time said for a screen reader, in minutes.
spoken-minutes =
    { $count ->
        [one] { $count } Minute
       *[other] { $count } Minuten
    }

# A length of time said for a screen reader, in seconds.
spoken-seconds =
    { $count ->
        [one] { $count } Sekunde
       *[other] { $count } Sekunden
    }

# Continue row: nothing new to watch, and the next episode airs at a known time. The time is already worded: "in 2d 3h".
continue-row-caught-up-airs = Auf dem neuesten Stand · E{ $episode } erscheint { $when }

# Continue row: nothing new to watch, and the next episode has no date.
continue-row-caught-up-not-out = Auf dem neuesten Stand · E{ $episode } ist noch nicht da

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-english = Englisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-japanese = Japanisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-spanish = Spanisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-portuguese = Portugiesisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-french = Französisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-german = Deutsch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-italian = Italienisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-russian = Russisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-arabic = Arabisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-indonesian = Indonesisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-korean = Koreanisch

# Name of a language, in a list of subtitle languages.
language-name-chinese = Chinesisch

# Seasonal's format toggle: every format.
seasonal-format-all = Alle

# Seasonal's format toggle: ONA, OVA and specials together.
seasonal-format-ona-ova = ONA und OVA

# Accessible name of a title's banner, which opens its page.
title-open-named = { $title } öffnen

# Accessible name of a card or row in Continue: the title, then what is said under it.
continue-row-spoken = { $title }, { $detail }

# Accessible name of the pane beside Continue's queue that previews the selected title.
continue-preview = Vorschau

# Under a suggestion that airs later today when no episode number is known: the time it airs.
up-next-airs-at = Erscheint um { $time }

# Header title on a terminal too narrow for the rail: the product name, then the section on screen.
chrome-header-section = anistream · { $section }

# Header chip while the metadata sources are degraded. The mark is a status glyph. Shown beside the { -source } chips, which are short.
chrome-meta-chip = Metadaten { $mark }

# Activity row: how many more running jobs there are than fit. It follows the last job shown.
chrome-activity-more = +{ $count }

# Activity row: a running job that is held up (a rate-limit pause), with the wait counting down. The note says what it waits on; the countdown is a clock such as 0:12.
chrome-job-held = { $note }, { $countdown }

# Heading of an overlay that lists the lines of a long table: which lines are in view.
overlays-window-position = { $from }–{ $to } von { $total }

# Heading of the help overlay when its table does not fit on one page.
overlays-help-page = Seite { $page } von { $pages }

# The log overlay, when nothing has been logged this session.
overlays-logs-empty = Noch nichts protokolliert

# Prompt hint under the manual search heading. The footer names its keys.
overlays-hint-manual-query = Gib ein, wonach gesucht werden soll, oder lass es leer für den automatischen Abgleich.

# Prompt hint for the first step of signing in to Kitsu.
overlays-hint-kitsu-username = E-Mail-Adresse oder Benutzername.

# Prompt hint for the second step of signing in to Kitsu. The password is shown as dots.
overlays-hint-kitsu-password = Dein Passwort wird gegen ein Token getauscht und nicht gespeichert.

# Prompt hint for the download range. The examples are episode numbers and stay as written.
overlays-hint-download-range = 4 für eine Episode, 1-12 für eine Reihe, 7- für alles ab dort.

# Prompt hint for editing a setting: its label on the Settings screen. The footer names the keys.
overlays-hint-edit-setting = Gib einen neuen Wert für { $setting } ein.

# Prompt hint for joining a { -plugin-store }.
overlays-hint-join-store = Füge die Einladung oder den Link zum Store ein, den du bekommen hast.

# Prompt hint for naming the person an invite link is for.
overlays-hint-invite-name = Der Name der Person, so wie ihn die Mitgliederliste zeigt.

# Overlay heading after the title: the plugin's version and the { -plugin-store } it comes from. The plugin's name leads the heading.
overlays-heading-plugin = { $name }   { $version }  ·  von { $store }

# Overlay heading, after the title "Invite link": whom the link is for.
overlays-heading-invite-for = Für { $name }

# Title of the invite link overlay when the link is not for a named person.
overlays-title-link-device = Link für ein weiteres Gerät

# Overlay heading, after the title of the store's link: which { -plugin-store } it opens.
overlays-heading-open-link-of = { $store }

# Overlay heading, after the title of the publish list: where the plugin goes.
overlays-heading-publish-to = Nach { $store }

# Overlay heading, after the title "Which one": the title being matched.
overlays-heading-disambiguate = Treffer für { $name }

# Overlay heading, after the title "Watch order": the title the order is built around.
overlays-heading-watch-order = Rund um { $name }

# Overlay heading, after the title "Recommended": the title the list came from.
overlays-heading-recommendations = Weil dir { $name } gefallen hat

# Overlay heading, after the title of the release list.
overlays-heading-release = Die anderen Quellen füllen aus, was fehlt.

# Overlay heading, after the title of the { -source } list: the choice is kept for this title.
overlays-heading-source = { $name }

# Overlay heading, after the title of the releases list: the episode it is for.
overlays-heading-releases = Episode { $episode }. Enter spielt deine Wahl ab.

# Same, when no episode is known.
overlays-heading-releases-bare = Enter spielt deine Wahl ab.

# Toast: a download that is finished cannot be cancelled, only deleted. The key is the delete key.
toast-download-done = Schon heruntergeladen. Drück { $delete }, um ihn und seine Datei zu löschen.

# Toast: a command needs a title and none is selected.
toast-nothing-selected = Nichts ist ausgewählt. Wähl zuerst einen Titel aus.

# Toast: the download-range key was pressed away from the episode table.
toast-ranges-elsewhere = Bereiche werden in der Episodentabelle eingereiht.

# Toast: the filter key was pressed on a screen without filters.
toast-filters-elsewhere = Filter gibt es in der Suche und in der Episodentabelle.

# Toast: a watched-mark key was pressed away from the episode table.
toast-watched-elsewhere = Die Markierungen für „gesehen“ gibt es in der Episodentabelle.

# Toast: Back was pressed at the top of a section. The key is the quit key.
toast-at-top = Du bist ganz oben. Drück { $quit }, um zu beenden.

# Toast: an action was run that does nothing on this screen. The action is its label, such as "Mark all previous watched"; the place says where it works, such as "in the episode table".
toast-works-elsewhere = { $action } funktioniert { $place }.

# Toast: the bug report is being opened.
toast-bug-report-opening = Der Fehlerbericht wird im Browser geöffnet. Der Link steht im Protokoll.

# Log line holding the whole bug report link, for a terminal that cannot open it.
tui-log-bug-report-link = Fehlerbericht: { $url }

# Toast: a key binding in the config file was refused. The problem says which and why.
toast-keybinding-not-applied = Tastenbelegung nicht übernommen: { $problem }. Prüf den Abschnitt keys in der Konfigurationsdatei.

# Standing notice: the config file did not load. The problem is the parser's own text.
tui-config-problem = { $file }: { $what }. Bis das behoben ist, gelten die Standardwerte.

# Same, when the problem is on a known line.
tui-config-problem-at-line = { $file }, Zeile { $line }: { $what }. Bis das behoben ist, gelten die Standardwerte.

# Log line for the same problem. The path is the whole path of the config file.
tui-config-problem-logged = { $path }: { $problem }. Es gelten die Standardwerte.

# The status line at the foot of the screen when nothing is being said: the source in use, the audio and the quality.
chrome-status-state = { $source } · { $audio } · { $quality }p

# Heading of the title page when no title is highlighted.
title-heading = Titel

# Under the heading of the title page and the episode table when no title is highlighted.
title-nothing-selected-note = Nichts ausgewählt

# Toast when a title action is asked for and no title is highlighted.
title-nothing-selected = Nichts ist ausgewählt. Markiere einen Titel und versuche es erneut.

# Toast when something that needs a title's full page is asked from a list.
title-trailer-off-page = Öffne die Seite des Titels, um den Trailer zu finden.

# Toast when something that needs a title's full page is asked from a list.
title-recommendations-off-page = Öffne die Seite des Titels, um die Empfehlungen zu sehen.

# Toast when something that needs a title's full page is asked from a list.
title-seasons-off-page = Öffne die Seite des Titels, um die zugehörigen Staffeln zu sehen.

# Toast when a title has no trailer on record.
title-no-trailer = Zu diesem Titel ist kein Trailer hinterlegt.

# Toast when a title has no recommendations.
title-no-recommendations = Zu diesem Titel sind keine Empfehlungen bekannt.

# Toast when a title has no connected seasons.
title-no-seasons = Zu diesem Titel sind keine zugehörigen Staffeln bekannt.

# Toast when the { -source } picker is asked for from a list.
title-pin-off-page = Öffne die Seite des Titels, um dafür eine Quelle auszuwählen.

# Toast when the { -source } picker is asked for and no { -source } is registered. They register a moment after launch.
